# reports/ is governed by reports/.gitignore, which keeps the JSON summaries and
# drops the derived images and pages. Excluding the directory here would override that:
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
data/llm_cache.sqlite

# Local agent pointer. The rules themselves live in ENGINEERING_RULES.md, which is
# tracked; this file exists only so tooling picks them up and is deliberately private.
CLAUDE.md

# Build-plan and strategy documents. Kept locally, deliberately not published:
